' @guidance:
' Create or update the C4 Component-level PlantUML diagram for the project.
'
' - If a C4 Component diagram already exists.
' - If no diagram exists, generate a new one that clearly represents all major components, their responsibilities, and interactions within the project.
' - Use PlantUML C4-PlantUML syntax and best practices for clarity and maintainability.
' - Include only relevant components from `/src/main/java` and external systems; remove or omit unnecessary details.
' - Organize the diagram for readability, avoiding complexity and clutter.
' - Add SHOW_LEGEND() at the end of the puml code.

@startuml c4-diagram
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/plantuml-stdlib/C4-PlantUML/master/C4_Component.puml

LAYOUT_LEFT_RIGHT()

title Ghostwriter MCP Server - Component Diagram

Person_Ext(mcpClient, "MCP Client", "AI assistant, IDE, or automation process that invokes MCP tools.")

' This module packages dependencies; src/main/java contains no local components.
' Keep dependency internals out of scope rather than inventing a decomposition.
Container(gwMcpServer, "Ghostwriter MCP Server", "Java 17 executable JAR", "Packages the Machai MCP runtime, Ghostwriter tools, and Bindex Core metadata and recommendation capabilities.")

note bottom of gwMcpServer
  No local Java components exist in src/main/java.
  Entry point supplied by machai-mcp-server:
  org.machanism.machai.mcp.server.McpServer
  Configuration: mcp-server.properties; optional gw.properties.
end note

System_Ext(genAiProvider, "Configured Generative AI Provider", "Provider used by model-assisted Ghostwriter workflows, such as CodeMie.")
System_Ext(packageRepos, "Maven / Library Metadata Sources", "External repositories and indexes used for dependency metadata and library recommendations.")
System_Ext(bindexRegistry, "Bindex Registry", "External Bindex service that stores and serves registered metadata descriptors.")

Rel(mcpClient, gwMcpServer, "Invokes MCP tools and resources", "STDIO / HTTP")
Rel(gwMcpServer, genAiProvider, "Requests model-assisted processing through Ghostwriter", "Provider API")
Rel(gwMcpServer, packageRepos, "Looks up dependency metadata and recommendations through Bindex Core", "Repository/index APIs")
Rel(gwMcpServer, bindexRegistry, "Retrieves and registers Bindex descriptors through Bindex Core", "Bindex API")

SHOW_LEGEND()
@enduml
